            <h3>
                <span class="title"><a target="_parent" href="/scc-csc/scc-csc/en/item/18169/index.do?q=Odhavji+Estate+v.+Woodhouse+2003+SCC+69">Nevsun Resources Ltd. v. Araya</a></span>
                        - <span class="citation">2020 SCC 5</span>
                    - <span class="report-citation">[2020] 1 SCR 166</span>
                - <span class="publicationDate">2020-02-28</span>
            </h3>
            <div class="subMetadata">
